10:04:15 settled
🟠 cart in shop (prod-eu-1) and five other workloads keep crashing with the same error: they cannot reach their cache (Redis), and the error does not name the address. The failing pods run on nodes n1 and n2, which joined 1 minute before they began failing. It fails with "StackExchange.Redis.RedisConnectionException: It was not possible to connect to the redis server(s). Error connecting…". Affected: invoicer and ledger in billing; thumbs in media; and two others.
Related alerts: 1 exit alert, 1 not-ready pod
The error does not name the cache address: find it in cart's configuration, the environment variables and the ConfigMaps or Secrets it reads, and check that it is reachable from shop.
